+- Full-run `step1-decisions.mjs check` stops while parsing `items/def-qftx-gaga-coherent-section-topology.md`: its unquoted `locator` value beginning `Chapter IX §4.C, printed pp. 422–424: coherent-section quotient ...` is invalid YAML at frontmatter line 25. This is outside batch 65 and was left unchanged. The six assigned records were checked individually and are current.
